e]\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWrinkle Resistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSHEEX® Performance Fabric: 87% Polyester \/ 13% Spandex\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMachine Wash. Easy Care.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFIT\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLoose, relaxed fit. Fits true to size.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDESIGN DETAILS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSlightly scooped neckline\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSet-in sleeves\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCut-out back detail\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlat lock stitching detail\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHi-low hem\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSHEEX® logo at front hem\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSLEEP•FIT® technology\u003c\/strong\u003e - High-tech materials with integrated functional performance, focusing on \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003esensation \u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eand the importance of \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003efeel, fit \u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eand \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003ecomfort\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e during sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection aria-labelledby=\"tab3\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-title=\"Care\" class=\"ootb-tabcordion--entry\" id=\"tab3-tab\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ootb-tabcordion--entry-container\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ootb-tabcordion--entry-content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse cold water and choose a regular cycle with no bleach or fabric softener. Do not use fabric dryer sheets. Tumble dry on low. Do not iron.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003csection aria-labelledby=\"tab4\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-title=\"Size Guide\" class=\"ootb-tabcordion--entry\" id=\"tab4-tab\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=