03eTransform your bedroom into a high-performance sleep sanctuary with the \u003cstrong data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"396\"\u003eSHEEX® Ultimate Sleep System Bundle\u003c\/strong\u003e — the most complete collection of SHEEX innovation in one seamless set. This deluxe bundle includes \u003cstrong data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"536\"\u003eeverything you need\u003c\/strong\u003e for a fully upgraded bed, from the cooling base layer to the ultra-cozy top layer: our \u003cstrong data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"647\"\u003eArctic Aire•MAX Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"702\" data-start=\"683\"\u003ePillowcase Pair\u003c\/strong\u003e, Original Performance \u003cstrong data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"704\"\u003eDuvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"721\"\u003eNightfall Cloud Comforter\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"821\" data-start=\"800\"\u003efour plush pillows\u003c\/strong\u003e, and our temperature-regulating \u003cstrong data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"854\"\u003ePerformance Mattress Pad\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for hot sleepers, athletes, or anyone serious about rest and recovery, this bundle takes sleep performance to the next level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1025\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1029\"\u003eWhat’s Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1050\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1152\" data-start=\"1050\"\u003e1 × \u003cstrong data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1056\"\u003eArctic Aire•MAX Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1093\" data-start=\"1090\"\u003e(Includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003e1 × \u003cstrong data-end=\"1199\" data-start=\"1159\"\u003eArctic Aire•MAX Pillowcase Pair\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1246\" data-start=\"1202\"\u003e1 × \u003cstrong data-end=\"1244\" data-start=\"1208\"\u003eOriginal Performance Duvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1313\" data-start=\"1247\"\u003e1 × \u003cstrong data-end=\"1284\" data-start=\"1253\"\u003eSHEEX® Nightfall Cloud Comforter\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1352\" data-start=\"1314\"\u003e4 × \u003cstrong data-end=\"1350\" data-start=\"1320\"\u003eSHEEX® Performance Pillows\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1353\"\u003e1 × \u003cstrong data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1359\"\u003eSHEEX® Performance Mattress Pad\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"1438\" data-start=\"1435\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1467\" data-start=\"1440\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1467\" data-start=\"1444\"\u003eWhy You'll Love It:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"1506\" data-start=\"1469\"\u003e💨 \u003cstrong data-end=\"1506\" data-start=\"1477\"\u003eCooler Sleep, Every Layer\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003eArctic Aire•MAX \u0026amp; \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1543\" data-start=\"1511\"\u003eOriginal Performance bedding\u003c\/strong\u003e is crafted with advanced moisture-wicking, breathable fabric that pulls heat and sweat away from your body to keep you cool, dry, and comfortable all night long.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1707\"\u003e🛌 \u003cstrong data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1715\"\u003eComplete Comfort, Top to Bottom\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom the \u003cstrong data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1760\"\u003etemperature-regulating mattress pad\u003c\/strong\u003e to the \u003cstrong data-end=\"1831\" data-start=\"1807\"\u003eall-season comforter\u003c\/strong\u003e, every element in this bundle is designed to work in harmony—keeping you cozy without overheating, 365 days a year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1949\"\u003e💤 \u003cstrong data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1957\"\u003eSupport That Adapts\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong data-end=\"2008\" data-start=\"1985\"\u003ePerformance Pillows\u003c\/strong\u003e provide just the right blend of softness and support, contouring to your head and neck to relieve pressure and enhance alignment for deeper, uninterrupted sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2221\" data-start=\"2172\"\u003e🌙 \u003cstrong data-end=\"2221\" data-start=\"2180\"\u003ePerformance-Focused, Athlete-Inspired\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOriginally developed by elite athletes, SHEEX® bedding combines technical innovation with luxurious softness—engineered to move with your body, not against it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2423\" data-start=\"2383\"\u003e🧺 \u003cstrong data-end=\"2423\" data-start=\"2391\"\u003eLow Maintenance, High Impact\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll items are \u003cstrong data-end=\"2459\" data-start=\"2438\"\u003ewrinkle-resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"2477\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003equick-drying\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-end=\"2503\" data-start=\"2483\"\u003emachine washable\u003c\/strong\u003e, making care effortless while maintaining long-lasting softness and durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"2588\" data-start=\"2585\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2614\" data-start=\"2590\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2614\" data-start=\"2594\"\u003eBundle Benefits:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2896\" data-start=\"2615\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2615\"\u003eSave significantly with this complete bedding solution\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2733\" data-start=\"2672\"\u003eIdeal for hot sleepers, active lifestyles, and modern homes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2844\" data-start=\"2798\"\u003eStylish, coordinated look from top to bottom\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2896\" data-start=\"2845\"\u003eMakes an exceptional gift or full bedroom upgrade\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"2901\" data-start=\"2898\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2927\" data-start=\"2903\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2927\" data-start=\"2907\"\u003eProduct Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"3432\" data-start=\"2928\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3011\" data-start=\"2928\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2970\" data-start=\"2930\"\u003eFabric (Sheets \u0026amp; Pillowcases):\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% TENCEL® Lyocell - Earth Friendly \u0026amp; Hypoallergenic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3011\" data-start=\"2928\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3034\" data-start=\"3014\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2970\" data-start=\"2930\"\u003eDuvet: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e87% Microfiber Polyester \/ 13% Spandex\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3063\" data-start=\"3012\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3034\" data-start=\"3014\"\u003eComforter Shell:\u003c\/strong\u003e 90% Cooling Nylon\/10% Spandex\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3116\" data-start=\"3064\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3085\" data-start=\"3066\"\u003eComforter Fill:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight down-alternative\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3181\" data-start=\"3117\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3136\" data-start=\"3119\"\u003eMattress Pad:\u003c\/strong\u003e Quilted with breathable performance fabric\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3254\" data-start=\"3182\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3196\" data-start=\"3184\"\u003ePillows:\u003c\/strong\u003e Hypoallergenic with adaptive fill for comfort \u0026amp; support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3312\" data-start=\"3255\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3271\" data-start=\"3257\"\u003eSheet Fit:\u003c\/strong\u003e Accommodates mattresses up to 18\" deep\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3386\" data-start=\"3313\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3334\" data-start=\"3315\"\u003eCertifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e OEKO-TEX® certified for safety and sustainability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3432\" data-start=\"3387\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"3398\" data-start=\"3389\"\u003eCare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine wash cold, tumble dry low\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"3437\" data-start=\"3434\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3483\" data-start=\"3439\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"3481\" data-start=\"3442\"\u003eUpgrade to Total Performance Sleep.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne bundle. Every layer. Infinite comfort.\u003cbr data-end=\"3529\" data-start=\"3526\"\u003eExperience the cooling, breathable, performance-enhanced sleep system that only SHEEX® can deliver.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-02T10:37:36-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-02T10:37:35-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","arctic","breathable","Cooling Sheet Sets","Cooling Sheets","Moisture Wicking","night sweats","Performance Bedding","pickystory","Queen","Sheet Sets","temperature regulating","YGroup_aa_sheets"],"variants":[{"id":49487473967242,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"1260.32","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"0.00","position":1,"product_id":9082808729738,"created_at":"2026-06-02T10:37:35-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41282792587402,"created_at":"2026-06-02T10:37:35-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T10:37:37-04:00","product_id":9082808729738,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780411034924.jpg?v=1780411057","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9082773471370,"title":"Active Comfort Essential Bedding Bundle","handle":"active-comfort-essential-bedding-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"710\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"334\"\u003eBetter Sleep Starts Here.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"337\"\u003eUpgrade your entire bed with the ultimate sleep system designed for peak comfort and performance. The Nightfall Essential Bedding Bundle includes everything you need to transform your sleep experience. Our breathable, moisture-wicking \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"614\"\u003eActive Comfort Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"635\"\u003ePillowcase Pair\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eOriginal Performance \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"656\"\u003eDuvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e — all crafted from our innovative performance fabric.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"736\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"736\"\u003eWhat's Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e1 × Active Comfort Sheet Set (includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases - Twin\/TwinXL includes 1 PC)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e1 ×  \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eActive Comfort Pillowcase Pair\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e1 × Original Performance Duvet Cover (includes two shams)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Comforter not included.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"984\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"984\"\u003eWhy You'll Love It:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1030\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1028\"\u003eCool to the Touch, All Night Long\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1199\"\u003eOur ultra-soft, lightweight fabric is engineered with advanced moisture-wicking and temperature control technology to keep you cool and dry, even on the warmest nights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1248\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eBetter Sleep, Powered by Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1399\"\u003eDeveloped by athletes, our bedding is built to breathe. SHEEX® performance fabric transfers heat and promotes airflow for deeper, uninterrupted sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1444\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1442\"\u003eSofter Than Cotton. Smarter Too.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003eForget scratchy sheets. Our proprietary fabric feels silky-smooth and stretches with your every move—no bunching, no sticking, no hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1631\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1629\"\u003eWrinkle-Resistant \u0026amp; Easy to Care For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003eThis bundle looks as good as it feels. Machine washable, quick-drying, and wrinkle-resistant, SHEEX® bedding saves you time and effort without sacrificing luxury.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003eBundle Benefits:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003eSave more when you buy as a set\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003eComplete cohesive look for your bedroom\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003eIdeal for hot sleepers or active lifestyles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1952\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003eTech Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003eSheet set fits mattresses up to 18\" deep\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003eOEKO-TEX® certified: Safe, sustainable, and skin-friendly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2130\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2298\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2194\"\u003eExperience the difference of performance-engineered sleep.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2197\"\u003eShop the SHEEX® Original Performance Bedding Bundle today and wake up refreshed, restored, and ready.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-02T10:11:20-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-02T10:11:19-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","breathable","Cooling Sheet Sets","Moisture Wicking","night sweats","Performance Bedding","Queen","Sheet Sets","temperature regulating"],"variants":[{"id":49487422029962,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"462.65","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"487.00","position":1,"product_id":9082773471370,"created_at":"2026-06-02T10:11:19-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41282731475082,"created_at":"2026-06-02T10:11:19-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T10:11:21-04:00","product_id":9082773471370,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780409374759.jpg?v=1780409481","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9082756595850,"title":"Nightfall Essential Bedding Bundle","handle":"nightfall-essential-bedding-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"710\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"334\"\u003eBetter Sleep Starts Here.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"337\"\u003eUpgrade your entire bed with the ultimate sleep system designed for peak comfort and performance. The Nightfall Essential Bedding Bundle includes everything you need to transform your sleep experience. Our breathable, moisture-wicking \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"614\"\u003eNightfall Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"635\"\u003ePillowcase Pair\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eOriginal Performance \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"656\"\u003eDuvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e — all crafted from our innovative performance fabric.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"736\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"736\"\u003eWhat's Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e1 × Nightfall Sheet Set (includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases - Twin\/TwinXL includes 1 PC)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e1 ×  \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eNightfall Pillowcase Pair\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e1 × Original Performance Duvet Cover (includes two shams)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Comforter not included.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"984\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"984\"\u003eWhy You'll Love It:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1030\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1028\"\u003eCool to the Touch, All Night Long\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1199\"\u003eOur ultra-soft, lightweight fabric is engineered with advanced moisture-wicking and temperature control technology to keep you cool and dry, even on the warmest nights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1248\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eBetter Sleep, Powered by Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1399\"\u003eDeveloped by athletes, our bedding is built to breathe. SHEEX® performance fabric transfers heat and promotes airflow for deeper, uninterrupted sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1444\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1442\"\u003eSofter Than Cotton. Smarter Too.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003eForget scratchy sheets. Our proprietary fabric feels silky-smooth and stretches with your every move—no bunching, no sticking, no hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1631\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1629\"\u003eWrinkle-Resistant \u0026amp; Easy to Care For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003eThis bundle looks as good as it feels. Machine washable, quick-drying, and wrinkle-resistant, SHEEX® bedding saves you time and effort without sacrificing luxury.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003eBundle Benefits:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003eSave more when you buy as a set\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003eComplete cohesive look for your bedroom\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003eIdeal for hot sleepers or active lifestyles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1952\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003eTech Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003eSheet set fits mattresses up to 18\" deep\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003eOEKO-TEX® certified: Safe, sustainable, and skin-friendly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2130\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2298\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2194\"\u003eExperience the difference of performance-engineered sleep.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2197\"\u003eShop the SHEEX® Original Performance Bedding Bundle today and wake up refreshed, restored, and ready.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-02T09:59:09-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-02T09:59:08-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","Cooling Sheet Sets","Moisture Wicking","nightfall","Performance Bedding","Queen","Sheet Sets","YGroup_nfsheetset","YGroup_Nightfall_bundle"],"variants":[{"id":49487373074570,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"709.65","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"747.00","position":1,"product_id":9082756595850,"created_at":"2026-06-02T09:59:08-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41282691858570,"created_at":"2026-06-02T10:00:07-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T10:00:10-04:00","product_id":9082756595850,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780408788561.jpg?v=1780408810","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9082734739594,"title":"Arctic Aire•MAX Essential Bedding Bundle","handle":"arctic-aire-max-essential-bedding-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"710\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"334\"\u003eBetter Sleep Starts Here.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"337\"\u003eUpgrade your entire bed with the ultimate sleep system designed for peak comfort and performance. The Arctic Aire•MAX Essential Bedding Bundle includes everything you need to transform your sleep experience. Our breathable, moisture-wicking \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"614\"\u003eArctic Aire•Max Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"635\"\u003ePillowcase Pair\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eOriginal Performance \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"656\"\u003eDuvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e — all crafted from our innovative performance fabric.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"736\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"736\"\u003eWhat's Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e1 × Arctic Aire•MAX Sheet Set (includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e1 ×  Arctic Aire•MAX Pillowcase Pair\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e1 × Original Performance Duvet Cover (includes two shams)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Comforter not included.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"984\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"984\"\u003eWhy You'll Love It:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1030\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1028\"\u003eCool to the Touch, All Night Long\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1199\"\u003eOur ultra-soft, lightweight fabric is engineered with advanced moisture-wicking and temperature control technology to keep you cool and dry, even on the warmest nights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1248\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eBetter Sleep, Powered by Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1399\"\u003eDeveloped by athletes, our bedding is built to breathe. SHEEX® performance fabric transfers heat and promotes airflow for deeper, uninterrupted sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1444\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1442\"\u003eSofter Than Cotton. Smarter Too.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003eForget scratchy sheets. Our proprietary fabric feels silky-smooth and stretches with your every move—no bunching, no sticking, no hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1631\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1629\"\u003eWrinkle-Resistant \u0026amp; Easy to Care For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003eThis bundle looks as good as it feels. Machine washable, quick-drying, and wrinkle-resistant, SHEEX® bedding saves you time and effort without sacrificing luxury.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003eBundle Benefits:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003eSave more when you buy as a set\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003eComplete cohesive look for your bedroom\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003eIdeal for hot sleepers or active lifestyles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1952\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003eTech Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003eSheet set fits mattresses up to 18\" deep\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003eOEKO-TEX® certified: Safe, sustainable, and skin-friendly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2130\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2298\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2194\"\u003eExperience the difference of performance-engineered sleep.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2197\"\u003eShop the SHEEX® Original Performance Bedding Bundle today and wake up refreshed, restored, and ready.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-02T09:43:13-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-02T09:43:12-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","arctic","breathable","Cooling Sheet Sets","Cooling Sheets","Moisture Wicking","night sweats","Performance Bedding","pickystory","Queen","Sheet Sets","temperature regulating","YGroup_aa_sheets"],"variants":[{"id":49487344795786,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"614.65","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"647.00","position":1,"product_id":9082734739594,"created_at":"2026-06-02T09:43:12-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41282643230858,"created_at":"2026-06-02T09:44:37-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T09:44:40-04:00","product_id":9082734739594,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_Arctic-Bundles-Essential-1.jpg?v=1780407880","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9081762381962,"title":"Active Comfort Starter Bundle","handle":"active-comfort-starter-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eActive Comfort Starter Bundle will work hard when you’re at rest. Performance fibers channel moisture and heat away from your body and maintain ideal body temperature for quality sleep. SHEEX® innovative cooling bedding brings deep benefits at night to enhance the day.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur RIDICULOUSLY SOFT® fabrics breathe 10x better than traditional cotton sheets, allowing air to circulate freely around your body to maintain an ideal sleep temperature. And our technical fibers wick moisture away from your skin 2x-3x better than traditional cotton to facilitate faster evaporation, making sure you don't wake up damp or sweaty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSHEEX® PERFORMANCE SLEEP\u003c\/strong\u003e | Sleep Cool. Sleep Dry. Sleep Comfortable.®\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-01T20:03:56-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-01T20:03:55-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","breathable","Cooling Sheet Sets","Moisture Wicking","night sweats","Performance Bedding","Queen","Sheet Sets","temperature regulating"],"variants":[{"id":49484330926218,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"131.60","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"188.00","position":1,"product_id":9081762381962,"created_at":"2026-06-01T20:03:55-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41278514921610,"created_at":"2026-06-01T20:03:55-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T20:03:58-04:00","product_id":9081762381962,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780358616964.jpg?v=1780358638","width":750,"height":750},{"id":41278562271370,"created_at":"2026-06-01T20:08:28-04:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T20:08:29-04:00","product_id":9081762381962,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_ActiveComfort-SheetSets-BlueSky-3.jpg?v=1780358909","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9081736396938,"title":"Nightfall Starter Bundle","handle":"nightfall-starter-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eMeet Nightfall™, the next evolution in performance bedding. Crafted from our advanced Cooling Nylon\/Spandex blend, this silky-smooth fabric delivers the ultimate in lightweight luxury. Naturally breathable and temperature-regulating, Nightfall keeps you cool, dry, and comfortable all night long. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspired by the calm of a tranquil lakeside retreat, Nightfall turns your bed into a sanctuary of serenity. Its whisper-light ultra-soft drape glides effortlessly across your skin, reducing friction to help minimize frizz, sleep lines, and dryness, so you wake refreshed and flawless. Each night, its cooling, effortlessly soft touch hugs your body in a cocoon of calm, creating a restful escape where tension fades and dreams take center stage. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for warm sleepers and anyone who craves an airy, indulgent sleep experience, Nightfall redefines what performance bedding can be: effortless, restorative, and beautifully cool.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-01T19:48:37-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-01T19:48:36-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","Cooling Sheet Sets","Moisture Wicking","nightfall","Performance Bedding","Queen","Sheet Sets","YGroup_nfsheetset","YGroup_Nightfall_bundle"],"variants":[{"id":49484255920266,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"319.20","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"338.00","position":1,"product_id":9081736396938,"created_at":"2026-06-01T19:48:36-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41278423597194,"created_at":"2026-06-01T19:48:36-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T19:48:38-04:00","product_id":9081736396938,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780357709659.jpg?v=1780357718","width":750,"height":750},{"id":41278467506314,"created_at":"2026-06-01T19:58:02-04:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T19:58:03-04:00","product_id":9081736396938,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_Nightfall-SheetSets-SandDune-7.jpg?v=1780358283","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9081711132810,"title":"Arctic Aire•MAX Starter Bundle","handle":"arctic-aire-max-starter-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eMade from naturally \u003cstrong\u003ehypoallergenic fibers\u003c\/strong\u003e, our \u003cstrong\u003e100% TENCEL™ Lyocell\u003c\/strong\u003e SHEEX® Arctic Aire•MAX Sheet Sets are \u003cstrong\u003esofter than silk\u003c\/strong\u003e and thoughtfully designed to wick moisture away, keeping your body cool and comfortable while you sleep.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTENCEL™ Lyocell fibers contain submicroscopic channels that help regulate absorption and then release moisture for the restful and restorative night’s sleep that you deserve. TENCEL™ is engineered with the ability to naturally reduce the growth of bacteria without any chemical additives. The super-fast moisture transport system and carefully engineered fibers allow you to stay fresh, clean, and healthy while you sleep.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eComplete your Arctic Aire•MAX bedding collection with our \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/best-sellers\/products\/arctic-aire-max-diamond-collection-quilt-and-shams\" title=\"Diamond Collection\"\u003eArctic Aire•MAX Diamond Collection Quilt Set\u003c\/a\u003e!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet SHEEX Own the Night®, so you can own your day.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSHEEX® \u003c\/strong\u003ePERFORMANCE SLEEP\u003cstrong\u003e | \u003c\/strong\u003eComfort can not be compromised.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-01T19:25:12-04:00","created_at":"2026-06-01T19:25:11-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","arctic","breathable","Cooling Sheet Sets","Cooling Sheets","Moisture Wicking","night sweats","Performance Bedding","pickystory","Queen","Sheet Sets","temperature regulating","YGroup_aa_sheets"],"variants":[{"id":49484222627978,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"247.95","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"330.60","position":1,"product_id":9081711132810,"created_at":"2026-06-01T19:25:11-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41278342889610,"created_at":"2026-06-01T19:25:11-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T19:25:14-04:00","product_id":9081711132810,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780356243111.jpg?v=1780356314","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9081684885642,"title":"Original Performance Starter Bundle","handle":"original-performance-starter-bundle-1","body_html":"\u003cp\u003ePut an end to over-heating and other sleep-disrupting t