mondQuilt-Shams-Silver-3.jpg?v=1780675678","width":750,"height":750},{"id":38221206290570,"created_at":"2025-06-02T11:47:04-04:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-04-10T10:27:55-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/DiamondCollection-PDP-Stack_5a778927-dd7b-49b2-91e0-7937cb8dd3b2.jpg?v=1775831275","width":1200,"height":867},{"id":41317380456586,"created_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:52-04:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:54-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[46368458408074,46368458440842],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_DiamondQuilt-Shams-Navy-2.jpg?v=1780675674","width":750,"height":750},{"id":41317380423818,"created_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:52-04:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:54-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_DiamondQuilt-Shams-Navy-1.jpg?v=1780675674","width":750,"height":750},{"id":41317380489354,"created_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:52-04:00","position":12,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:54-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_DiamondQuilt-Shams-Navy-3.jpg?v=1780675674","width":750,"height":750},{"id":38221205930122,"created_at":"2025-06-02T11:47:00-04:00","position":13,"updated_at":"2026-04-10T10:27:55-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/DiamondCollection-PDP-Stack_fa0e5074-1d21-4eed-9f96-11af0199238c.jpg?v=1775831275","width":1200,"height":867},{"id":41317379768458,"created_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:42-04:00","position":14,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:44-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[46368458342538,46368458375306],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_DiamondQuilt-Shams-Charcoal-2.jpg?v=1780675664","width":750,"height":750},{"id":41317379735690,"created_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:42-04:00","position":15,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:44-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_DiamondQuilt-Shams-Charcoal-1.jpg?v=1780675664","width":750,"height":750},{"id":41317379801226,"created_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:42-04:00","position":16,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T12:07:44-04:00","product_id":8585648046218,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/SHEEX_PDP_DiamondQuilt-Shams-Charcoal-3.jpg?v=1780675664","width":750,"height":750}],"options":[{"name":"Choose Your Color","position":1,"values":["Ivory","Silver","Navy","Charcoal"]},{"name":"Choose Your Size","position":2,"values":["Standard\/Queen","King\/Cal King"]}]},{"id":8670026137738,"title":"Original Performance Essential Bundle","handle":"original-performance-essential-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"710\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"334\"\u003eBetter Sleep Starts Here.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"337\"\u003eUpgrade your entire bed with the ultimate sleep system designed for peak comfort and performance. The SHEEX® Original Performance Starter Bedding Bundle includes everything you need to transform your sleep experience. Our breathable, moisture-wicking \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"614\"\u003eOriginal Performance Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"635\"\u003ePillowcase Pair\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"656\"\u003eDuvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e — all crafted from our innovative performance fabric.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"736\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"736\"\u003eWhat's Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"829\"\u003e1 × Original Performance Sheet Set (includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"872\"\u003e1 × Original Performance Pillowcase Pair\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"950\"\u003e1 × Original Performance Duvet Cover (includes two shams)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Comforter not included.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"984\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"984\"\u003eWhy You'll Love It:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1030\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1028\"\u003eCool to the Touch, All Night Long\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1199\"\u003eOur ultra-soft, lightweight fabric is engineered with advanced moisture-wicking and temperature control technology to keep you cool and dry, even on the warmest nights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1248\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eBetter Sleep, Powered by Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1399\"\u003eDeveloped by athletes, our bedding is built to breathe. SHEEX® performance fabric transfers heat and promotes airflow for deeper, uninterrupted sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1444\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1442\"\u003eSofter Than Cotton. Smarter Too.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003eForget scratchy sheets. Our proprietary fabric feels silky-smooth and stretches with your every move—no bunching, no sticking, no hassle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1631\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1629\"\u003eWrinkle-Resistant \u0026amp; Easy to Care For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003eThis bundle looks as good as it feels. Machine washable, quick-drying, and wrinkle-resistant, SHEEX® bedding saves you time and effort without sacrificing luxury.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1825\"\u003eBundle Benefits:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1859\"\u003eSave more when you buy as a set\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1901\"\u003eComplete cohesive look for your bedroom\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1947\"\u003eIdeal for hot sleepers or active lifestyles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1952\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1973\"\u003eTech Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2022\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2022\"\u003eFabric: 87% microfiber polyester \/ 13% spandex\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2065\"\u003eSheet set fits mattresses up to 18\" deep\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2125\"\u003eOEKO-TEX® certified: Safe, sustainable, and skin-friendly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2130\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2298\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2194\"\u003eExperience the difference of performance-engineered sleep.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2197\"\u003eShop the SHEEX® Original Performance Bedding Bundle today and wake up refreshed, restored, and ready.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-12T10:15:21-04:00","created_at":"2025-09-12T10:15:20-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"Bedding Set","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","Cooling Sheet Sets","Cooling Sheets","Moisture Wicking","Performance Bedding","pickystory","Queen","Sheet Sets","YGroup_op_sheets"],"variants":[{"id":47044956979338,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"709.65","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"747.00","position":1,"product_id":8670026137738,"created_at":"2025-09-12T10:15:20-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41279731630218,"created_at":"2026-06-01T22:43:15-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T22:43:17-04:00","product_id":8670026137738,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780368167795.jpg?v=1780368197","width":750,"height":750},{"id":39158217867402,"created_at":"2025-09-15T11:29:07-04:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:31:43-04:00","product_id":8670026137738,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/03-DuvetCover.jpg?v=1757950303","width":1200,"height":867},{"id":39158217900170,"created_at":"2025-09-15T11:29:07-04:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:29:08-04:00","product_id":8670026137738,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/01-SS.jpg?v=1757950148","width":1200,"height":867},{"id":39158217769098,"created_at":"2025-09-15T11:29:07-04:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:32:23-04:00","product_id":8670026137738,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/02-BonusPCs.jpg?v=1757950343","width":1200,"height":867}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8668956262538,"title":"Original Performance Comfort Bedding Bundle","handle":"original-performance-comfort-bedding-bundle","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"436\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"434\"\u003eThe Complete Comfort Bundle: Your Best Night’s Sleep, All in One Set\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"849\"\u003eTransform your bedroom into a sleep sanctuary with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"553\"\u003eSHEEX® Complete Comfort Bundle Set\u003c\/strong\u003e. Thoughtfully curated with our most loved essentials, this bundle delivers the perfect balance of \u003cstrong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"720\"\u003ecooling comfort, breathable performance fabrics, and cozy warmth\u003c\/strong\u003e. Designed to help you fall asleep faster and sleep deeper, it’s everything you need for year-round comfort—at a bundled value.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"872\"\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1362\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1005\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1005\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"910\"\u003eOriginal Performance® Sheet Set\u003c\/strong\u003e – Our signature cooling, breathable sheets that wick away moisture and regulate temperature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1103\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1103\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1029\"\u003eBonus Pillowcases\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extra softness and convenience for a polished, complete bedding look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1244\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1244\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1143\"\u003eOriginal Performance® Duvet Cover\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth, lightweight, and easy to care for—protects your comforter while enhancing breathability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1362\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1362\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1271\"\u003eAll Season Comforter\u003c\/strong\u003e – Lofty yet lightweight, designed to keep you cozy in the winter and cool in the summer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1382\"\u003eKey Benefits\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1805\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1509\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1509\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1416\"\u003eCooler Nights, Deeper Sleep\u003c\/strong\u003e – Performance fabrics breathe better than cotton and actively wick away heat and moisture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1626\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1626\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1538\"\u003eYear-Round Versatility\u003c\/strong\u003e – The All Season Comforter and breathable duvet cover adapt to changing temperatures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1730\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1730\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1657\"\u003eComplete Bedding Upgrade\u003c\/strong\u003e – Everything you need in one bundle to instantly refresh your bedroom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1805\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1805\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1746\"\u003eEasy Care\u003c\/strong\u003e – Machine washable, wrinkle-resistant, and made to last.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1982\"\u003eSleep better from night one with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1893\"\u003eComplete Comfort Bundle Set\u003c\/strong\u003e—crafted to deliver \u003cstrong data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1979\"\u003ecooling performance, cozy softness, and all-season versatility\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-10T21:34:10-04:00","created_at":"2025-09-10T21:34:10-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00","vendor":"SHEEX","product_type":"","tags":["_exclude_stock_tag","Cooling Sheet Sets","Cooling Sheets","Moisture Wicking","Performance Bedding","pickystory","Queen","Sheet Sets","YGroup_op_sheets"],"variants":[{"id":47038973051018,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"1049.75","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"1105.00","position":1,"product_id":8668956262538,"created_at":"2025-09-10T21:34:10-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T01:45:21-05:00"}],"images":[{"id":41279749193866,"created_at":"2026-06-01T22:51:22-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-01T22:51:24-04:00","product_id":8668956262538,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0073\/6061\/0375\/files\/story-idjuukxc91i-1780368640810.jpg?v=1780368684","width":750,"height":750},{"id":39158217900170,"created_at":"2025-09-15T11:29:07-04:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:29:08-04:00","product_id":8668956262538,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0